EP-TYPED TITLE-BELIEF DOSSIER -- REAL PUBLIC RECORDS (M-RI-13)
Parcel: PIN 29-02-408-053-0000
14347 Woodlawn Ave, Dolton, IL 60419 (Cook County)
======================================================================

Informational analysis of public records for demonstration
purposes. NOT a title opinion, title insurance commitment, or
legal advice. Records as retrieved on dates listed in MANIFEST.

M-RI-11 dossier re-run with EP set-valued uncertaintyType
(capability-factory canon CF-020) attached to every claim.
Type map frozen in pilot/ep_typing_preregistration.md BEFORE
the typed pipeline existed. Closed five-term vocabulary:
  measured - estimated - asserted-by-interested-party -
  inferred-from-proxy - true-as-of-date-decaying
Sets are 1+ terms; matching is membership, never string form.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
SECTION 1: TYPED EVIDENCE INTAKE
----------------------------------------------------------------------

  obs_o1_ccao_owner  [ccao_parcel_sales, ltime 26]
    current_owner <- CSMA BLT LLC (m=0.8, Omega=0.2)
    uncertaintyType: [measured]
    from ccao_parcel_sales.json record 97219177, field(s): buyer_name
    raw value: 'CSMA BLT, LLC'

  obs_o2_assessor_owner  [cc_assessor, ltime 35]
    current_owner <- FIRSTKEY HOMES (m=0.6, Omega=0.4)
    uncertaintyType: [measured]
    from cc_assessor.json record 290240805300002026, field(s): owner_address_name
    raw value: 'FIRST KEY HOMES'

  obs_o3_crm_disposition  [sslbda_crm, ltime 25]
    sslbda_disposition <- conveyed (m=0.5, Omega=0.5)
    uncertaintyType: [asserted-by-interested-party]
    from crm_extract.json record 258, field(s): USER_disp_status, USER_date_disposed
    raw value: 'Sold 2017-01-01'

  obs_o4_ccao_disposition  [ccao_parcel_sales, ltime 26]
    sslbda_disposition <- not_conveyed (m=0.8, Omega=0.2)
    uncertaintyType: [inferred-from-proxy, measured]
    from ccao_parcel_sales.json record 97219177, field(s): seller_name, doc_no, sale_date
    raw value: 'RICHARD  THORTON'
    PROXY EXPLANATION (A2 inference): The recorded conveyance at the window the CRM claims SSLBDA disposed (doc 1717247010, 2017-06-16) names grantor RICHARD THORTON, not SSLBDA; this is read as evidence SSLBDA did not convey the parcel.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
SECTION 2: TYPE ASSIGNMENT RATIONALE (PRE-REGISTERED)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

  O1 [measured]: recorded deed (doc 1717247010) -- the
     buyer_name field is read off an instrument of record.
  O2 [measured]: assessor roll row -- an administrative record
     of what the roll states, not an estimate (GO ruling R1).
  O3 [asserted-by-interested-party]: SSLBDA's CRM self-reports
     SSLBDA's own inventory state; SSLBDA is the interested
     party. Temporal term true-as-of-date-decaying DROPPED per
     pre-registration 1a: CF-020's validUntil:null normatively
     means DOES-NOT-DECAY, so 'asserted 2017-01-01, staleness
     unbounded' is inexpressible without fabricating an expiry
     (no-fab).
  O4 [inferred-from-proxy, measured]: the deed row is measured
     (recorded instrument); the not_conveyed claim is INFERRED
     from grantor identity as proxy (grantor is RICHARD
     THORTON, not SSLBDA). Dual-typed -- the set is the point.
     First real inferred-from-proxy encode in the EP canon.

