----------------------------------------------------------------------
SECTION 4: EPISTEMIC JUSTIFICATION
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Types below are read back from the ri_core justification
records (project() step 2g), not from this script's inputs --
the type flows through the reconciliation layer.

  Proposition: current_owner
    obs_o1_ccao_owner    [measured]
      Trusted as a MEASURED record: grantee read off recorded
      deed doc 1717247010; carries the deed-tier weight (0.8).
    obs_o2_assessor_owner [measured]
      A MEASURED administrative record of the roll's stated
      taxpayer name; carries the roll-tier weight (0.6).
    The 48.00% conflict is
    measured-vs-measured: two authentic records disagree, so
    the conflict is a records problem (REQUIRES VERIFICATION),
    not an artifact of a weak epistemic type on either side.

  Proposition: sslbda_disposition
    obs_o3_crm_disposition [asserted-by-interested-party]
      DISCOUNTED as an interested-party assertion: SSLBDA
      self-reports its own inventory state ('Sold',
      2017-01-01) -- and the assertion also SELF-CONTRADICTS
      the recorded deed record (doc 1717247010 names grantor
      RICHARD THORTON, not SSLBDA). The 0.5 weight is now
      EXPLAINED by the type, not merely assigned.
    obs_o4_ccao_disposition [inferred-from-proxy, measured]
      MEASURED deed row; the not_conveyed reading is INFERRED
      from grantor identity as proxy (see Section 1 PROXY
      EXPLANATION). The set carries both natures honestly.

  Why the type does work the weight cannot (decoration check,
  pre-registered discriminator):
    O1 and O4 carry the SAME weight (0.8 focal / 0.2 Omega)
    but DIFFERENT type sets -- [measured] vs
    [inferred-from-proxy, measured]. The weight cannot
    distinguish a direct reading from a proxy inference; the
    type can, and a membership query for 'everything
    inferred-from-proxy' returns exactly O4.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
